        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo nikasema, Ee Bwana MUNGU, tazama, roho yangu haikutiwa unajisi; maana tangu ujana wangu hata sasa sijala nyamafu, wala iliyoraruliwa na wanyama; wala nyama ichukizayo haikuingia kinywani mwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
